    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="49">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 49</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit sy elles landagende man, gilde VI healfmarc, healf Criste 7 healf landrican.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If it is otherwise a landowner, he is to pay six half-marks, half to Christ and half to the lord of the estate.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he is a landholder of another kind, he is to pay six half-marks: half to Christ, half to the local lord.</ab>
      </div>
